-- 支持全区间 + 机位触发 意味着这个 iState 将在进入对应 idle 的第一时间被自动触发;  这个机制可用来实现 "启动后第一动作" 这个功能
---@return boolean @ 确认 freeCameraSpatialRange_ 是否支持全区间
function IdolLive3D_Utils.IsFreeCameraSpatialRangeSupportAllRange( freeCameraSpatialRange_ ) 
    local f = freeCameraSpatialRange_
    local ret =     (f.yaw.isUse == false or f.yaw.range >= 360)
                and (f.pitch.isUse == false or (f.pitch.from < 0.0001 and f.pitch.to > 0.99999))
                and (f.zoom.isUse == false or (f.zoom.from < 0.0001 and f.zoom.to > 0.99999))
    return ret
end


--------------------------------
-- 检查参数 cameraSpatialParams_ 是否落在 tgtSpatialRange_ 区间内;
---@return boolean
function IdolLive3D_Utils:IsCameraSpatialParamsInRange( tgtSpatialRange_, cameraSpatialParams_, compareMode_ )
    if isNull(cameraSpatialParams_) then 
        printError("koko - cameraSpatialParams_ 参数异常")
        return false
    end 
    --- 有些 交互 不存在机位限制:
    if type(tgtSpatialRange_) ~= "table" then 
        return true
    end

    ---@type IdolLive3D_States
    local IdolLive3D_States = import('Game.IdolLive3D.IdolLive3D_States')
    ---
    local isLegal = {
        yaw = false,
        pitch = false,
        zoom = false
    }

    if isNull(tgtSpatialRange_.yaw) or tgtSpatialRange_.yaw.isUse == false then 
        isLegal.yaw = true
    else 
        isLegal.yaw = IdolLive3D_Utils:_CheckYawInfo(tgtSpatialRange_.yaw,cameraSpatialParams_)
    end 

    if isNull(tgtSpatialRange_.pitch) or tgtSpatialRange_.pitch.isUse == false then 
        isLegal.pitch = true
    else 
        isLegal.pitch = IdolLive3D_Utils:_CheckPitchInfo(tgtSpatialRange_.pitch,cameraSpatialParams_)
    end
    
    if isNull(tgtSpatialRange_.zoom) or tgtSpatialRange_.zoom.isUse == false then 
        isLegal.zoom = true
    else 
        isLegal.zoom = IdolLive3D_Utils:_CheckZoomInfo(tgtSpatialRange_.zoom,cameraSpatialParams_)
    end 
    --print( "y:" .. tostring(isLegal.yaw) .. ", p:" .. tostring(isLegal.pitch) .. ", z:" .. tostring(isLegal.zoom) )
    local ret = ( isLegal.yaw == true and isLegal.pitch == true and isLegal.zoom == true )
    if compareMode_ == IdolLive3D_States.CameraSpatialRangeCompareMode.Outside then 
        ret = not ret
    end 
    return ret
end

function IdolLive3D_Utils:_CheckYawInfo( iYaw_, cameraSpatialParams_ )
    local from = iYaw_.dirDegree - iYaw_.range * 0.5 
    local to   = iYaw_.dirDegree + iYaw_.range * 0.5 
    -- 很粗暴地比较了所有可能性, 不做精细地区分判断了:
    local a1 = cameraSpatialParams_.yaw - 360
    local a2 = cameraSpatialParams_.yaw
    local a3 = cameraSpatialParams_.yaw + 360
    return  (a1 >= from and a1 <= to) or
            (a2 >= from and a2 <= to) or
            (a3 >= from and a3 <= to)
end

function IdolLive3D_Utils:_CheckPitchInfo( iPitch_, cameraSpatialParams_ )
    return cameraSpatialParams_.pitch >= iPitch_.from and cameraSpatialParams_.pitch <= iPitch_.to
end

function IdolLive3D_Utils:_CheckZoomInfo( iZoom_, cameraSpatialParams_ )
    --print( "from: " .. tostring(iZoom_.from) .. ", to:" .. tostring(iZoom_.to) .. ", zoom:" .. tostring(cameraSpatialParams_.zoom) )
    return cameraSpatialParams_.zoom >= iZoom_.from and cameraSpatialParams_.zoom <= iZoom_.to
end


